<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>TokenVector.Data</id>
    <version>1.0.3</version>
    <title>TokenVector.Data - High-Performance Columnar DataFrame &amp; Tabular Engine (TokenVector Language)</title>
    <authors>TokenVector Project Team</authors>
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>
    <licenseUrl>https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT</licenseUrl>
    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <releaseNotes>1.0.3: CSV datetime &amp; encoding. parse_dates=[column names] on csv_read_ex/csv_read_chunks/csv_read_chunks_file (ISO strings -&gt; i64 epoch-ms via series_dt_parse, column name preserved, unknown names skipped). New csv_read_chunks_file_enc with encoding (utf-8/latin-1) + parse_dates; latin-1 byte-per-char full-file path, utf-8/default true streaming. UTF-8 BOM (EF BB BF) auto-stripped by runtime file-open layer. 16 check suites green incl. new pd_check (15 checks).</releaseNotes>
    <description>High-performance columnar DataFrame and tabular data processing library, natively implemented in the TokenVector language (tkv) and compiled to a .NET CIL DLL: schema, columns, series, vector math, filter, group-by, joins (incl. AsOf), pivot/melt, CSV/JSON IO, Arrow IPC stream and out-of-core batches, zero-copy Mat bridge for numerics.</description>
    <tags>dataframe columnar arrow feather csv json timeseries asofjoin tokenvector data</tags>
    <dependencies>
      <group targetFramework="net8.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
</package>
